OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,7,Fjust the odd passing shower. Some
OL,8,Fclear spells in the east but generally
OL,9,Fcloudier in the northwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FAnother hot day with
OL,12,Fvariable cloud and some sunshine.
OL,13,FMostly dry but with a few sharp
OL,14,Fshowers possible at times,
OL,15,Fparticularly in the afternoon and
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
