OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCooler
OL,6,Fand cloudier on Friday and Saturday
OL,7,Fwith sunny intervals and a few
OL,8,Fshowers. Mainly dry and bright on
OL,9,FSunday with a small chance of rain
OL,10,Flater.
